      "question": "How many times can I change my car driving test booking now?",
      "answer": {
        "status": "answered",
        "answer": "You can make 2 changes to a car driving test booking (this limit has applied since 31 March 2026, replacing the old limit of 6). Changing the date, time or test centre together counts as one change. Once you've used both, you must cancel and rebook.",
